https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T21:56:32Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T22:04:09Z","body":"Just to quickly paste the part of the code I highly suspect where the issue is to inform others:\n\n```c++\n// editor/plugins/editor_preview_plugins.cpp:327\n\nRef<PackedScene> pack = ResourceLoader::load(p_path, \"PackedScene\", ResourceFormatLoader::CACHE_MODE_IGNORE, &load_error); // no more cache issues?\nif (load_error != OK) {\n\tprint_error(vformat(\"Failed to generate scene thumbnail for %s : Loaded with error code %d\", p_path, int(load_error)));\n\treturn Ref<Texture2D>();\n}\nif (pack.is_null()) {\n\tprint_error(vformat(\"Failed to generate scene thumbnail for %s : Invalid scene file\", p_path));\n\treturn Ref<Texture2D>();\n}\n\nbool _scene_setup_success = _setup_packed_scene(pack); // We don't want tool scripts to fire off when generating previews\n```\n\nIn PR #102313 we use ```ResourceLoader``` to load the tscn files with flag CACHE_MODE_IGNORE, recursively strip all of the scripts within the scene using ```_setup_packed_scene()```, then instantiate it to capture the thumbnail afterwards. I suspect your problem is caused by loading a version of the scene with scripts stripped. Will look into it later. \n\nIf someone is familiar with ```ResourceLoader``` feel free to point out where the issue might be originated.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2971814746/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2971845031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107494#issuecomment-2971845031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107494","id":2971845031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xIsGn","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T22:14:14Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T22:14:14Z","body":"It should be likely using CACHE_MODE_IGNORE_DEEP instead, to make sure the instance loaded for preview has no shared (sub)resources.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2971845031/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://ap